  "notes": "Tiny project hierarchy, UART, FIFO, decoder, data control and QSPI form the baseline. Changes: FP16 execution, two lanes with shared arithmetic, and flat 512 B SRAM on MEM device 01. UART and QSPI remain byte-wide. MEM bit 9 adds SRAM accumulation. The previous core and host bridge are recoverable from Git. Physical macro artifacts still contain the previous core."
